#X text 20 10 THE DRUMS \, one [r \$0-hit<n>] each. KICK: a sine that drops from 150 to 48 Hz in 90 ms (its phase reset at every hit). SNARE: noise through a band pass plus a 190 Hz tone. HAT: noise through two high passes. RIM: two high sines \, 40 ms. Envelopes: [vline~] \, squared for a natural decay., f 150;
